{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1000_029umi", "source_sha256": "d20d04720c944732e1f5c2ffc6cb4b204526dcbd7287f67379a57cdf3647062a", "ja": "うーん？　うーん……。", "zh": "嗯？　嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ff64453ad86f4e3d9333ef64e5dbc611c0419380b38ab67735049a0a8e34847f", "ja": "海美、どうしたんだ？\n衣装にどこか、気に入らないところがあったとか？", "zh": "海美，怎么了？\n是对服装有什么不满意的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "84ca2779d953ef8267bedfb281f232e56b0b2b7a9cf585fd8c50f75f4f9e4a4d", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}♪\n気に入らないところ……？　ないない、そんなの！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}♪\n不喜欢的地方……？没有没有，才没有那种事呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1003_p", "source_sha256": "10b6534291c0bddc87c23cc336792d28c997b16a47c1cf372fb95ea1ab954479", "ja": "そのわりには、うんうん唸っていたような……？\n何かあるなら、遠慮しないでいいんだぞ？", "zh": "话虽这么说，可你刚才不是还一直苦思冥想吗……？\n有什么不满意的地方就别客气，尽管说出来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "ce0f2d5e9db973c1c312d4e25293dc95e8124934c6535cffa4a5bc3f5b785a03", "ja": "サイズはピッタリ！\nデザインも、ホントにカワイイよ☆", "zh": "尺寸正合身！\n设计也真的很可爱哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "4ce6aa1f55f3c468c1b1d57ada3a24e943edd24b15a07ab3919ea8f51e6407a2", "ja": "私、こういう着物っぽい衣装も好きなんだっ。\nおしとやかで女子力高い感じだよね♪", "zh": "我也很喜欢这种和服风格的服装呢。\n感觉文静优雅、很有女人味♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0c9382a8a7bf66051fb48cbd85779072fe0b70f6df2c6e5a5cffd8ca3c99245c", "ja": "じゃあ、なにを悩んでたんだ？", "zh": "那你刚才在烦恼什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "9758a95ae3ff42973cd2c306ad322ba6fa6f3afb542a337be0e04553fc2dd113", "ja": "あ、そっか！　えっとね、\n今、この衣装に合ったダンスを考えてたの☆", "zh": "啊，原来如此！那个嘛，\n我刚才正在想适合这套服装的舞蹈呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "e3d9352013930e263b17c044e6ddc5e07d1fade6c37702c0f3c537af36a0cd7b", "ja": "和服っぽい衣装でダンスするなら、\nやっぱり、バレエだと変かなーって……。", "zh": "要是穿着偏和风的服装跳舞，\n果然，跳芭蕾会很奇怪吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "efc7bf4dda9839ca203a1a0d2b1a0bf7529a7afd09461229498cf414ec567d21", "ja": "あ！　でも、この衣装で踊ったら、バレエでも\nなんでも日本舞踊ってことになっちゃうのかな？", "zh": "啊！不过，要是穿着这身衣服跳舞，不管跳的是不是芭蕾，都会被当成日本舞蹈吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1010_p", "source_sha256": "73d0fc10c5233c7ec475fedb45f747c1ca141925d2055f9d436b2c82a9fde0a4", "ja": "そうはならないと思うけど……。\nまあでも、そんなに意識しなくてもいいんじゃないか。", "zh": "我觉得不会变成那样……  \n不过，也不用太在意吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4ef657faac65af131089e788b4e4d342f16e6d91ba57b99332a59cd30555588f", "ja": "その衣装は、海美に合わせたものだから。\n海美が無理に、衣装に合わせる事はないよ。", "zh": "那套服装是按照海美的特点设计的。\n海美不用勉强自己去适应服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "58b9b67453233c8ba8fb1136516b678445dd1e294122cc887ce10402f0995f81", "ja": "そう？　バレエでも大丈夫？\nじゃあ、ちょっと試してみるね！", "zh": "这样吗？跳芭蕾也没问题？\n那我就稍微试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1013_p", "source_sha256": "7ee0db5e3b3cf1824a9f2794d3e1d827ec937bca560672b17edfaa67134e6420", "ja": "え？　試すって……。", "zh": "诶？你说要试试……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "a4eae806104a8482a0f66b50af9c6db075f3c485defbd8afff6c485cbf24ca21", "ja": "よーし！　それじゃあ……。\nえいっ、全力ターーーーン☆", "zh": "好——！那么接下来……\n嘿！全力旋转——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "c84db0051e04df336fc9e86663e19d9679b75ab66ee65741b4a4cf560a38e767", "ja": "わっ！？　何これ、すっごく回りやすーい！\nトゥシューズみたい！", "zh": "哇！？这是什么，转起来超顺畅的～！\n就像足尖鞋一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "2612cfb0311043d30c30602659676b093f7b51e8ef07afa2e3898cf55813ae5e", "ja": "こんなに踊りやすくて、カワイくて、\n女子力も高いなんて……すごすぎるーっ☆", "zh": "这么好跳、这么可爱，\n女孩子力还这么高……太厉害了——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1017_p", "source_sha256": "bae575fb8cb9b3f38ac4cb75cce49c1c2645a079439120be9e884b419bff7ee6", "ja": "あ、ああ……よかったな！\nでも海美、ここはドレスアップルームだから……。", "zh": "啊、啊啊……那真是太好了！\n不过海美，这里可是更衣室……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "8a0934d5f9618ee890658f9d0056946c7d7a3c6385c05457086bbfcc807d03f0", "ja": "じゃあ次は、うみみん☆ジャンプと、\nうみみん☆反復横跳びと、うみみん☆バランスね！", "zh": "那么接下来是海美美☆跳跃、\n海美美☆反复横跳，还有海美美☆平衡！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "6c5a01965a9fc97a86024d36040493356fdd52580c78b7c39ae13f81b136d9f1", "ja": "えいっ☆　とーっ☆", "zh": "嘿☆呀——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0174_1020_p", "source_sha256": "57652a1d71f3ccd50545706b0e35815520b803a26c5e6efb2b9b2cfeb453dc39", "ja": "（その後の海美の激しい動きにも、衣装が乱れる事は\nなかった……青羽さんの縫製技術は、さすがだな！）", "zh": "（在那之后海美的一连串激烈动作中，服装也没有乱……青羽小姐的缝纫技术，果然厉害啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
